    "enUS": {
      "description": "<Found near Shen'dralas, this dirty old tome no longer holds most of its knowledge.\r\n\r\nOf the text that remains, individual letters are difficult to distinguish from words. It may prove challenging to read at first, but one of them appears to be a surname.\r\n\r\nPerhaps its author, \"Evenshade\", may be found nearby.>",
      "dialogue": {
        "7628cc3c600034ef0542": "Is there something you need?"
      },
      "summary": "The text suggests the author of this journal may be somewhere in Shen'dralas.",
      "title": "Tattered Journal",
